    {
      "source": "<b>NOTE:</b> This callback won't be triggered for singleton beans\nlazily initialized on demand after <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> bootstrap,\nand not for any other bean scope either. Carefully use it for beans\nwith the intended bootstrap semantics only.",
      "translation": "<b>注意：</b>此回调不会为在 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 引导后按需懒式初始化的单例 Bean 触发，也不会为任何其他 Bean 作用域触发。请仅针对具有预期引导语义的 Bean 谨慎使用它。",
      "count": 1
    },
